#==============================================================================================
#
#   property_name - custom property names
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/PropertyName.h (lines 14-27): is_invalid_custom_property_name_string
#       and is_a_custom_property_name_string. They belong to the engine's PropertyName.h, but
#       the generated property_id_from_string and descriptor_id_from_string call them, so they
#       move down to css_data (a declaration move in the style of DESIGN.md §4.1.3); the engine
#       uses them from here.
#
